      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;aws-container-hero&#34;&gt;AWS Container Hero&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Super excited to be a part of &lt;a href=&#34;https://aws.amazon.com/developer/community/heroes/dijeesh-padinharethi/&#34;&gt;AWS Hero Program&lt;/a&gt;. I have been selected as one of the new AWS Container Hero along with &lt;a href=&#34;https://aws.amazon.com/developer/community/heroes/ben-bridts/&#34;&gt;Ben Bridts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://aws.amazon.com/developer/community/heroes/nana-janashia/&#34;&gt;Nana Janashia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://aws.amazon.com/developer/community/heroes/zainab-maleki/&#34;&gt;Zainab Maleki&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://aws.amazon.com/developer/community/heroes/daniel-rankov/&#34;&gt;Daniel Rankov&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://aws.amazon.com/developer/community/heroes/srushith-repakula/&#34;&gt;Srushith Repakula&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://aws.amazon.com/developer/community/heroes/shun-yoshie/&#34;&gt;Shun Yoshie&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://aws.amazon.com/developer/community/heroes/kenjiro-marumoto/&#34;&gt;Kenjiro Marumoto&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&#34;https://aws.amazon.com/developer/community/heroes/carlos-zambrano/&#34;&gt;Carlos Zambrano&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Here is the official AWS announcement blog post &lt;a href=&#34;https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/get-to-know-the-first-new-aws-heroes-of-2021&#34;&gt;https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/get-to-know-the-first-new-aws-heroes-of-2021&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dijeesh/dijeesh.github.io/master/assets/media/aws-container-hero.png&#34; alt=&#34;Architecture Diagram&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Thank you &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/company/amazon-web-services/&#34;&gt;Amazon Web Services&lt;/a&gt; (AWS), &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/rossbarich/&#34;&gt;Ross Barich&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/preetirajendran/&#34;&gt;Preeti Rajendran&lt;/a&gt; :)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Special thanks to &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/rashminambiar/&#34;&gt;Rashmi Nambiar, PMP&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/suman-d/&#34;&gt;Suman Debnath&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/rohinigaonkar&#34;&gt;Rohini Gaonkar&lt;/a&gt; and all #awsugindia ,#awsugkochi team members for the support.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
